===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gmw-pro|*fugl}}, from {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*fuglaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|ofs|fugel}}, {{cog|osx|fugal}}, {{cog|odt|fogal}}, {{cog|goh|fogal}}, {{cog|non|fugl}}, {{cog|got|𐍆𐌿𐌲𐌻𐍃}}.

